<view class="qx qx-flow"><view class="qx-flow-content"><view class="qx-sheet"><view class="qx-label">退款 / 退货退款</view><view class="qx-notice">首期请联系客服受理售后，按实际商品及数量办理。未发货可申请退款，已发货商品需按原售后政策退货验收。</view><view class="qx-about">{{service||'客服资料尚未配置'}}</view><button wx:if="service" class="qx-text" bindtap="copy">复制客服联系方式</button></view><view class="qx-sheet" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="id"><view class="qx-section-row"><view class="qx-label">{{item.statusName}}</view><view class="qx-price">{{item.amountText}}</view></view><view class="qx-muted">{{item.number}}</view><view class="qx-about">{{item.reason}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.lines}}" wx:for-item="line" wx:key="lineId" class="qx-info-row"><text>商品行 #{{line.lineId}}</text><text>退款 {{line.quantity}} 件</text></view><view wx:if="item.last_error" class="qx-notice">{{item.last_error}}</view><view wx:if="item.completed_at" class="qx-muted">实际完成：{{item.completed_at}}</view></view><view wx:if="!items.length" class="qx-empty">暂无售后记录</view><view wx:if="error" class="error">{{error}}</view></view></view>
